        <p source="#source-17761-17834"><seg source="#source-17761-17770">黄の、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17770-17785"><rb>嘴</rb><rt>はし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17785-17800">の、そよろ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17800-17827"><rb>化粧毛</rb><rt>けはひげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17827-17834">。</seg></p>
