      <div>
        <p source="#source-17998-18033"><seg source="#source-17998-18033">珠数かけ鳩はむきむきに</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-18033-18085"><seg source="#source-18033-18042">落ちし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18042-18060"><rb>杏</rb><rt>あんず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18060-18085">をつつくなり。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-18085-18132"><seg source="#source-18085-18100">しめりまだ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18100-18112"><rb>乾</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18112-18132">ぬ土のうへ、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-18132-18187"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18132-18150"><rb>杏</rb><rt>あんず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18150-18187">はあかし、そこここに。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-18187-18234"><seg source="#source-18187-18205">珠数かけ鳩の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18205-18220"><rb>虔</rb><rt>つつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18220-18234">ましさ、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-18234-18289"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18234-18249"><rb>脚</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18249-18289">にひろひぬ。飛び飛びに。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-18289-18336"><seg source="#source-18289-18295">空に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18295-18313"><rb>杏</rb><rt>あんず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18313-18336">の葉はにほひ、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-18336-18367"><seg source="#source-18336-18367">羽根に雫の色涼し。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-18367-18405"><seg source="#source-18367-18405">珠数かけ鳩は行き過ぎて、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-18405-18457"><seg source="#source-18405-18414">あかき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18414-18432"><rb>杏</rb><rt>あんず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18432-18457">につまづきぬ。</seg></p>
