      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-19354-19383"><seg source="#source-19354-19383">白き鷺、空に闘ひ、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-19383-19417"><seg source="#source-19383-19417">沛然と雨はしるなり。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-19417-19449"><seg source="#source-19417-19449">時は夏、青しののめ、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-19449-19483"><seg source="#source-19449-19483">濛濛と雨はしるなり。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-19483-19554"><seg source="#source-19483-19489">早や</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19489-19504"><rb>空</rb><rt>むな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19504-19516">し、かの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19516-19549"><rb>蓮華色</rb><rt>れんげしよく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19549-19554">。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-19554-19606"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19554-19578"><rb>二塊</rb><rt>ふたくれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19578-19606">の、夢に似る雲。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-19606-19647"><seg source="#source-19606-19647">くつがへせ、地軸はめぐる。</seg></p>
