        <p source="#source-19908-19925"><seg source="#source-19908-19925">きびしきは</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-19925-19954"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19925-19940"><rb>寒</rb><rt>かん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19940-19954">の冴え、</seg></p>
