        <p source="#source-21059-21100"><seg source="#source-21059-21080">さむざむし池の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21080-21092"><rb>面</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21092-21100">や、</seg></p>
