        <p source="#source-21302-21340"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21302-21317"><rb>番</rb><rt>つが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21317-21320">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21320-21335"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>どり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21335-21340">、</seg></p>
